  "desc": "以圣木所制的宝剑，据闻曾在一场战役里成为扭转胜负的关键。",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/09/18/44d909e22212bfaca8c72fa7e4bfd270_6674339642244055501.png",
